{
  "about": "Lasting types and their instances (editor spec §27, type_instance_split and instance_inherits_type). An instance links to its type with INSTANCE_OF, in its own graph or through a Ref to another. It has every property of its type unless it sets its own, the nearest value winning. typeOf, instancesOf and inherited (packages/graph-spec/src/mesh/types-instances.js) and their Python twins (python/graph_spec/src/graphspec/engine/mesh/types_instances.py) give these answers alike.",
